
Model for testing WATCH() and all its WATCH_xxx() variants.

Also: for testing that the parameterChanged() callback works. Try to change
parameter values from the GUI, and watch the output in the log window.

The Printability submodule demonstrates the string displayed for values that
have no @toString or str(): the output of operator<< if there is one;
otherwise "" for compound values (expand them to see their fields), and
"(unprintable)" for others. Covers watched variables, container elements,
pair members, smart pointer pointees, and message fields.
